Package: distkre
Type: Package
Title: Distributed Density-Ratio Estimation with Random Features
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Qinglong", "Tian", role = c("aut", "cre"),
    email = "qltian2021@gmail.com")
Author: Qinglong Tian [aut, cre]
Maintainer: Qinglong Tian <qltian2021@gmail.com>
Description: A direct implementation of distributed kernel unconstrained
    least-squares importance fitting (KuLSIF) using shared random Fourier
    features. The package implements the normalized random-feature KuLSIF
    estimator, its closed-form solution, the distributed gradient-descent
    algorithm from the accompanying draft, kernel KuLSIF baselines, Gaussian
    kernel-density-ratio baselines, and simulation utilities.
License: GPL (>= 3)
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports: stats
RoxygenNote: 7.3.2
